OL,3,GNEWSAFire station hours could be cut in
OL,4,Acost-saving plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FReducing hours at a fire station is one
OL,7,Fof the proposals aimed at addressing a
OL,8,Ffire service's #1.2m funding gap.
OL,10,FA public consultation on potential
OL,11,Fmeasures at Cleveland Fire Brigade
OL,12,Fopened earlier this month, including
OL,13,Fplans to reduce staffing of one of the
OL,14,Ftwo fire engines at Thornaby Station to
OL,15,Fdaytime hours only.
OL,17,FThe service said changing Thornaby's
OL,18,Fcrewing would have the "lowest impact"
OL,19,Fon service-wide response times compared
OL,20,Fwith other sites and added the safety
OL,21,Fof its communities remained its
OL,22,Fpriority.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
