OL,3,GNEWSAFire station hours could be cut in
OL,4,Acost-saving plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe consultation, which is open for 12
OL,7,Fweeks, closes on 26 November and would
OL,8,Fbe used to inform recommendations and
OL,9,Fsupport decision-making by the
OL,10,FCleveland Fire Authority, it said.
